Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Test Plugins|
		|portlet.plugins.includes|test-opensocial-pubsub-portlet|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given Page tear Down PG
Scenario: View Publisher Subscriber
Priority: 4
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Test Publisher Subscriber Page|
	When Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Publisher Portlet|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Publisher Subscriber Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Subscriber Portlet|
	And Click at locator 'TestSubscriber#SUBSCRIBER_PORTLET_SUBSCRIBE_BUTTON'
	Then Click at locator 'TestPublisher#PUBLISHER_PORTLET_PUBLISH_BUTTON'